# Prisma migration SQL: always LF in the repository and in every checkout
# (KI-009). Prisma records a checksum per applied migration; LF everywhere
# keeps the files byte-identical to what was applied, whatever a developer's
# core.autocrlf setting is. Scope is deliberately limited to migration SQL;
# all other files keep the existing Git line-ending behaviour.
apps/api/prisma/migrations/**/*.sql text eol=lf
